Derived, in modified form, from Fossity Probe:

    src/core/tree/          file tree, filtering and the banned list
    src/core/project/       project directory and its metadata
    src/core/pipeline/      the scanning, dependency, hint and packaging stages
    src/core/cipher/        package encryption
    src/core/obfuscation/   path obfuscation
    src/core/types.ts       shared types
    src/core/projectFiles.ts

Written for this program:

    src/core/lockfile/      lockfile parsers and their registry
    src/core/ScanRunner.ts  pipeline orchestration
    src/core/events.ts      scan progress events
    src/cli/                command line interface and terminal wizard
    src/runtime/            brand configuration, logging and scan options

This program depends on the scanoss SDK
